                <note rend="inline" type="source">710 Consultation (3)/46: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-12-15T18:00:00-03:00">December 15, 1941—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 15—5 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2050. For the Under Secretary. Department’s telegram No. 1376 December 14, 1 p.m.
                    Aranha agrees.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
